 rescue plan  without delay he then battles against  mojito for the second time but  unfortunately the cursed spirit was much  stronger than before and anonymity died  fighting it number six maki zemen if  there was ever an example of the word  underrated maki would definitely be it  maki is a grade four sorcerer and member  of the zenon family she is currently a  second year at tokyo jujutsu high maki's  ranking is not at all reflective of her  actual ability in battle her promotion  was stalled for years and she can easily  exercise a grade 2 curse her physical  prowess is second only to yuji itadori's  among the students and she is a master  of a wide assortment of different  weapons maki doesn't possess any cursed  energy but she more than compensates for  it using cursed tools compared to other  jujutsu students maki is often  underestimated however she was able to  effortlessly overwhelm miwa as well as  completely dominate her sister in a  fight maki has proven to be a valuable  asset in the battle against special  grade cursed spirits she and megumi were  able to buy enough time against hanami  for reinforcements to arrive while  fighting alongside naobito anonymi  against dagen maki was a step slower  than the experienced grade 1 sorcerers  but was still able to hold her own and  assist them in battle during the perfect  preparation arc maki enters the  warehouse at the zenon family house she  is greeted by her father ogie who tells  her that he's already disposed of all  the tools maki spots a wounded mind  behind her father and prepares to fight  him after a brief exchange of blows maki  breaks og's katana she attempts to  deliver the final blow however og  recreates his blade and slashes her  flank he drags both of his beaten up  daughters to the training room full of  her spirits and throws them in mai says  that she knew that twins are auspicious  for sorcerers in order to gain something  one must sacrifice something she then  proceeds to sacrifice her