 any of the previously  mentioned sorcerers but there is one guy  not even kenjaku can defeat which leads  us to first place on our list number one  gojo satoru even among the special great  sorcerers gojo is known to be the  strongest sorcerer in the series holding  both immense amounts of cursed energy  and a dangerously powerful technique as  a student gojo was capable of making  short work of experience in powerful  curse users after perfecting his skills  gojo's ability vastly increased to where  he was able to put toji fushiguru into  the defensive and ultimately kill him  with his strongest technique as he  continued to grow he eclipsed ghetto's  might to where ghetto admitted that gojo  has truly become the strongest ghetto  stated that gojo had the capability of  killing all of humanity by himself and  didn't even try to fight back when gojo  prepared to kill him in the present  gojo's might was feared by the  higher-ups of the jujutsu society to  where he could easily force them to  cancel the execution of a special great  sorcerer yuda in the sukuna's vessel  yuji he states that it would be easy for  him to kill them all and overthrow the  jujutsu society if he wanted to he even  claimed that he could defeat sukuna at  his full power kanjaku and his group of  extremely strong special great cursed  spirits were also wary of gojo's power  and skill with kanjaku admitting he  couldn't defeat gojo in direct battle he  was capable of completely overpowering  jogo the strongest curse in kinjaku's  group and simply his presence was able  to force hanami to retreat when konjaco  and his group finally developed a plan  to face him in combat despite their  preparations gojo was still capable of  easily fending off their assaults and  overpowering them leaving them astounded  with how powerful he is he managed to  overpower every special great curse  spirit in kanjaku's group at the same  time killing hanumi in the process he  was only defeated due to kinjaku using 